  "scope_constraints": [
    "先落TS真实纯类型/codec与唯一Rust+TS fixture，Root核读后A接线；不直接让A/B依报告猜接口。",
    "采用protocol3 optional inputAdmission1与strict positive limits，frame4 input-part、frame5 parser-reply，旧termination1保持；双方声明才启用。",
    "begin预留整笔bytes/userFIFO/resultslot；完整parts+commit才queued，claim与cancel同一线性化点，written仅PTY写完，响应丢失或部分写unknown不自动重放。",
    "每SID/input/resize共享FIFO，resize仅连续尾部coalesce并回superseded；parser reply独立有界保留而不宣称可抢占阻塞OS write。",
    "Node.write(false)该frame已提交，不重发；下一frame等drain且inflight/encodedbuffer/decoder/pending请求和op都有byte/count/timeout限额。",
